8. SYMBOLIC REASONING ENGINE
==================================================

CORE METHODS:

- Backward chaining
- Forward inference
- First-principles deduction
- Constraint propagation
- Rule application
- Hypothesis generation
- Proof search
- Backtracking
- Search pruning
- Memoisation
- Derivation reuse
- Dependency-aware invalidation

ITERATIVE REASONING:

GOAL
  |
  v
IDENTIFY REQUIRED KNOWLEDGE
  |
  v
QUERY KNOWLEDGE ENGINE
  |
